    "The page is an exercise headed Exercice, Réalisation régulière d’un polygône. It defines regular and normalized rectilinear realizations, gives a cyclotomic existence prompt, requests a similarity statement for two n-polygons with n at least 3, and ends with affine/vector envelopes and orientation.",
