    "The underlined words, cancellations, overwrites, bubble, curved isom arrow, and lower bent insertion lead are preserved. The sheet contains no commutative diagram or independent geometric polygon drawing; its graphic elements are the enclosure, connectors and two detached points.",
    "The live opening E and later V notation are retained without harmonization. Likewise P et P prime, the unaccented cotes, grâce : centre de gravité and local polygône spellings are not corrected.",
    "The text asks for the existence/uniqueness statement in b); it supplies no proof here. Mathematics prompted attention to the existential upright, but no mathematical expectation selected its glyph. No proof or numerical calculation was performed.",
    "The S packet is an empty array: no sweep rows required confirmation or overturning. H has no H_drawings supplement in this packet. Its editorial page marker and note prose are not included as manuscript text.",
    "All three supplied images were viewed once, in order: whole, a, b. Each enhanced crop was made once for a distinct open locus and visually inspected once. No OCR, recognition, PDF text layer, web research, other scan, other reader, or global decision file was used.",
    "The UTC start was captured after the first reading of the general brief/conventions and before the current-page packet and visual reading; no earlier timestamp is invented."
